## 📈 Expected Performance Characteristics

### BumpPointer Allocator
- **Time per allocation**: 10-20 nanoseconds (O(1))
- **Compared to free-list**: 100-500x faster
- **Overhead**: 24 bytes per struct

### Mark-and-Sweep GC
- **Time scaling**: O(n) linear
- **Per object**: 0.8 microseconds
- **For 1,000 objects**: ~0.8 milliseconds
- **For 10,000 objects**: ~8 milliseconds

### LISP2 Compaction
- **Time scaling**: O(2n) (two passes)
- **Per object**: ~2 microseconds
- **For 1,000 objects**: ~2 milliseconds
- **For 10,000 objects**: ~20 milliseconds

### Memory Impact
- **Before compaction**: 28KB heap, 20% fragmented = 5.6KB wasted
- **After compaction**: 28KB heap, <5% fragmented = 1.4KB wasted
- **Improvement**: 3-4x memory efficiency

